# Proposed by the swarm's review (2026-10-14), from the product owner's replay; the documenter may edit or drop it.
# Story: four windows arranged, a small call window on the narrow Desktop column. Another window is walked to the
# right with ⌃⌥⌘→. The Desktop keeps a usable width and the call stays in view.
# Reference: T03 T16, A01.
open A
open B
open C
open D
arrange
open Zoom 260x300
move 105 1150 200 260 300
focus 101
dock right
expect visible 105
dock right
expect visible 105
dock right
expect visible 105
expect visible 101
expect camera root
